<title>POLAND: PBR APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.58 vs    2.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.61 vs    4.30</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  8.10 vs   11.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	20.87 vs   18.50</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  9.70 vs   11.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   16.85 vs   19.48</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 35.60 vs   35.22</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	72.46 vs   67.63</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
